  "prefLabel": "Pdab 203.07 Record Retention",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pdab 203.07 Record Retention. The board shall keep a decision or order on file in its records for at least 6 years following the date of the final decision or the date of the decision on any appeal, unless otherwise required by law.\n\nSource. #13500-A, eff 12-2-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pdab100-300.html"
